      "assumption": "The current concentration of AI infrastructure is a result of market failure and regulatory capture rather than inevitable technical efficiency.",
      "if_wrong": "If concentration is purely efficient, then governance would indeed be a 'tax' that mandates inefficiency and diminishes net societal utility."
    },
    {
